=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Nestroh}, near Bivouac #3, to accept the quest.
* Fish up {m:Delectable Orobon}, which drop a guaranteed (**{p:G|Guaranteed (100%)}**) {i:Delectable Orobon Steak|Delectable Orobon Steak|3959} upon defeat
** The steak will be chosen randomly from one of five different cuts: tail, stomach, cheeks, back, or liver.
* Return and trade the Orobon steak to Nestroh
** Only a liver cut will sate {n:Nestroh}'s hunger.
** All other cuts will be rejected, and it is possible to receive multiple undesired cuts.
*** __(Trivia)__ If you get a repeated undesired cut of a particular type, he'll say: "I know I've already tried this part, but who am I to say no to a good thing!"

=3 Fishing Testimonials
* The nearby west and north shores of the island work.
* {i:Halcyon Rod|Halcyon Rod|17015} + {p:Little Worm}, {p:Insect Ball}
** Will catch {i:Ruddy Seema|Ruddy Seema|5952}, {m:Famished Jagil}, Lobsters, the {m:Delectable Orobon} and the {m:Gurgling Crab}. Also has a chance to not get a bite.
** The Insect Ball seems to only catch monsters, and will get a No-Bite message otherwise.
* {i:S.H. Fishing Rod|S.H. Fishing Rod|17382} + Little Worm
** Will catch {m:Famished Jagil}, and a big fish. Most other fish are "too small." Any lost catches (even from too small) will lose your bait.
* {i:Comp. Fishing Rod|Comp. Fishing Rod|17381} + {p:Worm Lure}, {p:Minnow}, {p:Sinking Minnow}, {p:Shell Bug}, Little Worm or Insect Ball all work.
* {i:Mithran Fish. Rod|Mithran Fish. Rod|17380} + Shell Bug can successfully fish the {m:Delectable Orobon}.
* {i:Mithran Fish. Rod|Mithran Fish. Rod|17380} + {p:Minnow} works as well.
* {i:Carbon Fishing Rod|Carbon Fishing Rod|17384} + Little Worm, but I hope you are hungry for {i:lobster|Ulbukan Lobster|5960} and {m:crab|Gurgling Crab}.
* {i:Lu Shang's F. Rod|Lu Shang's F. Rod|17386} + {p:Fly Lure} works.
* {i:Lu Shang's F. Rod|Lu Shang's F. Rod|17386} + Insect Ball works.
* {i:Halcyon Rod|Halcyon Rod|17015} + {p:Minnow} works.
** This combination can also fish up aggressive crab and pugil enemies and a {k:Rusted pickaxe} key item for the {q:Don't Ever Leaf Me|Don't Ever Leaf Me|Don't Ever Leaf Me} quest.
* {i:Ebisu Fishing Rod|Ebisu Fishing Rod|17011} + {p:Minnow}; got the perfect cut {n:he's|Nestroh} looking for on 1st cast, 1st bite, 1st {i:steak|Delectable Orobon Steak|3959}, 1st cut-open. Fished at the {k:watercraft dock|Castoff Point} just north-west of him (north-eastern corner of G-9).
** {p:Minnow} seems quite decent for reeling in the {m:orobon|Delectable Orobon}. As I was also doing {q:Don't Ever Leaf Me|Don't Ever Leaf Me|Don't Ever Leaf Me}, I continued to fish after completing this quest. I got the {k:Rusted pickaxe} on the 15th cast: 11x {m:Delectable Orobon}, 2x {m:Famished Jagil}, 1x {i:Malicious Perch|Malicious Perch|5995}, 1x {k:Rusted pickaxe}.
* {i:Willow Fishing Rod|Willow Fishing Rod|17391} + {p:Minnow} (tested with 0 fishing skill) seems to work quite well for this.

